---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { dots } from '../lib/patterns.js';
const stepsBg = dots();
const linesBg = dots();
import site from '../data/site.json';
const mailto = `mailto:${site.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Project inquiry')}`;
---
<Base title="Software, AI systems, and physical parts" description={site.tagline}>
  <Hero variant="graph" tall eyebrow={`${site.legalName} · ${site.location}`} title="Less busywork. More business.">
    <p class="lede">I'm JT Embry. Embry Development, LLC is my one-person studio in the Louisville area. I build AI assistants, custom software, and 3D-printed parts, backed by ten years of finance and healthcare engineering.</p>
    {site.booking && (
      <Fragment slot="actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-book>Book a free consultation</button>
      </Fragment>
    )}
  </Hero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Hear the AI buzzwords and wonder what you're missing?</h2>
      <p>You are not alone. Most businesses have work that AI can already do, and most owners don't know it yet. That is where I come in. I learn how your business runs, show you which tasks AI can handle, and build the tools that handle them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="field-agent">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Field Agent: your business on your phone</h2>
      <p>Field Agent is my main product. It is a phone app that talks to an AI assistant at your office. The assistant knows your business: every file, email, customer, and quote on your office computer, reached over an encrypted line.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>From the truck, ask "What did we quote this customer?" and get the quote.</li>
        <li>Ask for the follow-up email, and it is drafted from the thread.</li>
        <li>Open the app and see what needs you today.</li>
        <li>Your records stay on your own computer, and nothing changes until you tap Allow.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>It works today. I run my own business on it, and a demo shows it best.</p>
      <p>{site.booking && <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-book>Book a demo</button>} <a href="/work#field-agent">See how it connects</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section band band-parallax">
    <div class="band-bg" set:html={linesBg} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What I build</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="index">01</p>
          <h3>Knowledge assistants for small practices</h3>
          <p class="problem">"Our knowledge is in documents nobody can search."</p>
          <p>A private assistant that searches your own files, runs on servers you control, and answers with citations. The method is called <a href="/knowledge-assistants#rag">RAG</a>: it looks up your documents before it answers. Field Agent puts it on your phone. <a href="/knowledge-assistants">How it works</a></p>
          <p>Then <a href="/knowledge-assistants/ai-adoption">four weeks of training</a> so your team actually uses it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="index">02</p>
          <h3>Custom software for any business</h3>
          <p class="problem">"We pay for five tools and still run the business on a spreadsheet."</p>
          <p>No off-the-shelf box. I learn how your business runs and build around it, with your leaders' input at every step. You own the code and the records. <a href="/software">How it works</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="index">03</p>
          <h3>Rapid Prototyping (CAD) & 3D printing</h3>
          <p class="problem">"We need a part, a prototype, or a small run that no catalog sells."</p>
          <p>CAD from your sketch or measurements, working prints, and small batches. You get the part and the files. <a href="/printing">How it works</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section band-parallax">
    <div class="band-bg" set:html={stepsBg} aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How a job goes</h2>
      <p>Until recently, work like this took a team of developers. With AI tools, I do it alone, and fast.</p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><strong>Tell me the problem.</strong> One email is enough. I'll tell you whether I should build it.</li>
        <li><strong>Get a one-page scope.</strong> It says what you get, what it costs, and when, at a fixed price wherever I can scope the work.</li>
        <li><strong>See it every week.</strong> You see working software each week, not a reveal at the end.</li>
        <li><strong>Own it.</strong> You own the code, the files, and the parts, and you can take them anywhere.</li>
      </ol>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={mailto}>Email me</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
